      },
      "summaries": {
        "en": "Workerd is the open-source JavaScript/WebAssembly runtime engine that powers Cloudflare Workers, enabling developers to deploy serverless applications at the network edge for ultra-low latency. Its technical innovation lies in implementing the V8 JavaScript engine in a secure, isolated sandbox environment that can execute code across thousands of lightweight threads simultaneously. Developers can use it to build edge-native applications like API gateways, real-time data processing pipelines, or A/B testing frameworks by writing standard JavaScript/TypeScript that runs directly on Cloudflare's global network infrastructure.",
        "zh": "Workerd 是 Cloudflare Workers 背后的开源 JavaScript/WebAssembly 运行时引擎，它让开发者能够在网络边缘部署无服务器应用，实现超低延迟响应。其核心技术在于将 V8 JavaScript 引擎封装在安全的沙箱环境中，支持数千个轻量级线程同时执行代码，这种设计既保证了性能又确保了隔离性。开发者可以用它构建边缘原生应用，如 API 网关、实时数据处理管道或 A/B 测试框架，只需编写标准的 JavaScript/TypeScript 代码即可直接在 Cloudflare 的全球网络上运行，非常适合需要快速全球部署的场景。",
        "es": "Workerd is the open-source JavaScript/WebAssembly runtime engine that powers Cloudflare Workers, enabling developers to deploy serverless applications at the network edge for ultra-low latency. Its technical innovation lies in implementing the V8 JavaScript engine in a secure, isolated sandbox environment that can execute code across thousands of lightweight threads simultaneously. Developers can use it to build edge-native applications like API gateways, real-time data processing pipelines, or A/B testing frameworks by writing standard JavaScript/TypeScript that runs directly on Cloudflare's global network infrastructure.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "workerd gives teams a dependable path to production-ready AI tooling.",
          "what": "Workerd is the open-source JavaScript/WebAssembly runtime engine that powers Cloudflare Workers, enabling developers to deploy serverless applications at the network edge for ultra-low latency. Its technical innovation lies in implementing the V8 JavaScript engine in a secure, isolated sandbox environment that can execute code across thousands of lightweight threads simultaneously. Developers can use it to build edge-native applications like API gateways, real-time data processing pipelines, or A/B testing frameworks by writing standard JavaScript/TypeScript that runs directly on Cloudflare's global network infrastructure.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/cloudflare/workerd for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
      },
