      "summaries": {
        "en": "Claude-HUD is a Claude Code plugin that provides real-time visibility into AI assistant operations, addressing the 'black box' problem where users can't see what tools or agents are active during complex tasks. It works by creating a persistent status line that displays context usage, active tools, running agents, and todo progress as Claude processes requests. Developers can install it via Claude Code's plugin system to monitor AI workflows, debug agent behavior, or optimize context usage in coding, research, or automation projects where understanding the AI's step-by-step process is valuable.",
        "zh": "Claude-HUD是一款Claude Code插件，通过实时状态栏将AI助手的工作过程可视化，解决操作不透明问题。它可显示上下文使用情况、活跃工具、运行中的智能体及任务进度，帮助用户在编程调试、研究分析等复杂任务中监控AI行为、优化上下文分配，特别适用于多步骤AI协作场景，使智能过程可观察、可优化。",
        "es": "Claude-HUD is a Claude Code plugin that provides real-time visibility into AI assistant operations, addressing the 'black box' problem where users can't see what tools or agents are active during complex tasks. It works by creating a persistent status line that displays context usage, active tools, running agents, and todo progress as Claude processes requests. Developers can install it via Claude Code's plugin system to monitor AI workflows, debug agent behavior, or optimize context usage in coding, research, or automation projects where understanding the AI's step-by-step process is valuable.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "claude-hud stands out for anthropic, claude, and claude-code in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "Claude-HUD is a Claude Code plugin that provides real-time visibility into AI assistant operations, addressing the 'black box' problem where users can't see what tools or agents are active during complex tasks. It works by creating a persistent status line that displays context usage, active tools, running agents, and todo progress as Claude processes requests. Developers can install it via Claude Code's plugin system to monitor AI workflows, debug agent behavior, or optimize context usage in coding, research, or automation projects where understanding the AI's step-by-step process is valuable.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/jarrodwatts/claude-hud for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
      },
